Vendored third-party plugins
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository vendors plugin content authored by third parties. Each vendored
plugin carries a .upstream.json recording its origin, licence and the upstream
commit it was taken from, and .github/workflows/sync-vendored-plugins.yml opens a
pull request when upstream moves, so a copy never drifts silently.

Content is vendored rather than referenced because Claude Desktop on third-party
inference only fetches marketplace plugins whose source is local to the
marketplace repository; a cross-repository source is listed to users but never
downloaded.

